    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Aggregate first-level analyses to detect consistency or contradictions across imaging metrics.\n\nDXA micro findings:\n{{ $('Micro DXA Metrics Review') }}\n\nClinical micro findings:\n{{ $('Micro Clinical Risk Review') }}\n\nPatient diagnosis report:\n{{ $('PatientPrompt') }}\n\nProduce: consistency verdict, suspicious patterns, and impact on confidence.",
