        "text": "=Aggregate first-level analyses for longitudinal and history clues.\n\nDXA micro findings:\n{{ $('Micro DXA Metrics Review') }}\n\nClinical micro findings:\n{{ $('Micro Clinical Risk Review') }}\n\nPatient diagnosis report:\n{{ $('PatientPrompt') }}\n\nProduce: history-based support/conflict for osteoporosis diagnosis and evidence limits.",
