        "text": "=Argue that osteoporosis is likely using second-level specialist aggregates:\nBone Density:\n{{ $('Bone Density Specialist') }}\n\nRisk Factors:\n{{ $('Risk Factor Specialist') }}\n\nComorbidities:\n{{ $('Comorbidity Specialist') }}\n\nLifestyle:\n{{ $('Lifestyle Specialist') }}\n\nImaging Consistency:\n{{ $('Imaging Consistency Specialist') }}\n\nClinical History:\n{{ $('Clinical History Specialist') }}",
        "messages": {
