        "text": "=Validate debate consistency.\nPRO round 3:\n{{ $('Pro Analyst R3') }}\n\nCON round 3:\n{{ $('Con Analyst R3') }}\n\nSecond-level specialist evidence:\n{{ $('Bone Density Specialist') }}\n{{ $('Risk Factor Specialist') }}\n{{ $('Comorbidity Specialist') }}\n{{ $('Lifestyle Specialist') }}\n{{ $('Imaging Consistency Specialist') }}\n{{ $('Clinical History Specialist') }}\n\nList factual contradictions, unsupported claims, and logical conflicts.",
