        "text": "=Make the final adjudication from all checks.\n\nPRO final:\n{{ $('Pro Analyst R3') }}\n\nCON final:\n{{ $('Con Analyst R3') }}\n\nContradiction check:\n{{ $('Contradiction Checker') }}\n\nSufficiency check:\n{{ $('Sufficiency Checker') }}\n\nReturn verdict class exactly as one of: Likely osteoporosis / Unlikely osteoporosis / Inconclusive. Also provide confidence (0-100) and 3 key reasons.",
